chain {"confidence":"medium","events":[{"actor_id":"EO:7048","char_end":2633,"char_start":624,"confidence":"medium","how_named":"parent_as_amended","id":"CHAIN:EO:7373#1","notes":"Change wording lead; chronology does not decide legal effect.","provision_text":"Executive Order\r\nAMENDMENT OF EXECUTIVE ORDER NO. 6910 , OF NOVEMBER 26, 1934 ,\r\nWITHDRAWING PUBLIC LANDS IN CERTAIN STATES\r\npart :\r\nWHEREAS Executive Order No. 6910, of November 26, 1934, provides in\r\n\"it is ordered that all of the vacant, unreserved and unappropriated public land in\r\nthe States of Arizona , California , Colorado , Idaho , Montana , Nevada , New Mexico ,\r\nNorth Dakota , Oregon , South Dakota , Utah and Wyoming be, and it hereby is ,\r\ntemporarily withdrawn from settlement , location, sale or entry, and reserved for\r\nclassification , and pending determination of the most useful purpose to which such\r\nland may be put in consideration of the provisions of said act of June 28 , 1934 , and\r\nfor conservation and development of natural resources .\" ; and\r\nWHEREAS it is doubtful whether the said Executive order applies to tracts\r\nsubsequently released from prior entry, selection , claim, withdrawal , or reservation ;\r\nand\r\nWHEREAS in the administration of the said act of June 28, 1934 (48 Stat .\r\n1269), it has been found expedient and necessary to permit consummation of ex￾changes of lands pursuant to the provisions of section 8 of the act :\r\nNOW, THEREFORE , by virtue of and pursuant to the authority vested in\r\nme by the act of June 25, 1910 (ch . 421, 36 Stat . 847), as amended by the act of\r\nAugust 24, 1912 (ch . 369, 37 Stat. 497), and by the said act of June 28, 1934 , the\r\nsaid Executive Order No. 6910 , of November 26 , 1934, is hereby amended so as\r\n(1) to make it applicable to all lands within the States mentioned therein upon the\r\ncancelation or release of prior entries , selections , or claims , or upon the revocation\r\nof prior withdrawals unless expressly otherwise provided in the order of revocation ;\r\nand (2) to authorize the Secretary of the Interior, in his discretion and in harmony\r\nwith the purposes of the said act of June 28, 1934, to accept title to base lands in\r\nexchange for other lands subject to such exchange under the terms of the said act .","sections_touched":["section 8"],"signing_date":"1935-05-20","source":{"acceptable_as_original":false,"filing_date":null,"grade":"official_printing","instrument_id":"EO:7048","location_confidence":"high","location_verified":false,"page_or_item":"HathiTrust hvd.hl2726 (GPO bound Executive orders, title range 6936-7261), PDF pages 389-390","requires_page_check":false,"sha256":"0a3b52659e143f43bfb0297a71782f5412f55d7ac65b87b4bd5071829aced3fa","signing_date":"1935-05-20","text_path":"jobs/photius-gpo-volumes/output/texts/EO_7048.txt","text_sha256":"8693f9b213fae1c7a3d0aca8adb392322c2f5452d4ec3a3883d608c5ee624892","url":"https://babel.hathitrust.org/cgi/pt?id=hvd.hl2726&seq=389"},"verb":"amend"},{"actor_id":"EO:7178","char_end":3565,"char_start":3182,"confidence":"medium","how_named":"parent_as_amended","id":"CHAIN:EO:7373#2","notes":"Change wording lead; chronology does not decide legal effect.","provision_text":"Executive Order No. 6910, of November 26, 1934, withdrawing for classification\nand other purposes all vacant, unreserved, and unappropriated public lands in the\nStates of Nevada and Oregon, and certain other States, as amended by Executive\nOrder No. 7048, of May 20, 1935, is hereby further amended to exclude from the pro-\nvisions of that order as amended the above-described lands.","sections_touched":["partial"],"signing_date":"1935-09-06","source":{"acceptable_as_original":false,"filing_date":null,"grade":"machine_read_government_printed_copy","instrument_id":"EO:7178","location_confidence":"high","location_verified":false,"page_or_item":"Executive_Orders_7082-7261.djvu; scanned pages 246-247; closing number tag 7178","requires_page_check":false,"sha256":"10b7e443418bbb4f0807495d9f84e6f1057b62fd259b58753e6045b302146cc9","signing_date":"1935-09-06","text_path":"jobs/mabillon-held-printings/output/texts/EO_7178.txt","text_sha256":"579e97061eea30a0b573f98e1606acf14dbaf9e9c25346072c0c529c22b7588b","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Executive_Orders_7082-7261.djvu"},"verb":"amend"},{"actor_id":"EO:7245","char_end":1825,"char_start":1429,"confidence":"medium","how_named":"parent_as_amended","id":"CHAIN:EO:7373#3","notes":"Change wording lead; chronology does not decide legal effect.","provision_text":"Executive Order No. 6910, of November 26, 1934, withdrawing for classification\nand other purposes all vacant, unreserved, and unappropriated public lands in the\nState of South Dakota, and certain other States, as amended by Executive Order\nNo. 7048, of May 20, 1935, is hereby further amended to exclude from the provisions\nof that order, as amended, the public lands in the above-described area.","sections_touched":["partial"],"signing_date":"1935-12-10","source":{"acceptable_as_original":false,"filing_date":null,"grade":"machine_read_government_printed_copy","instrument_id":"EO:7245","location_confidence":"high","location_verified":false,"page_or_item":"Executive_Orders_7082-7261.djvu; scanned pages 422-423; closing number tag 7245","requires_page_check":false,"sha256":"10b7e443418bbb4f0807495d9f84e6f1057b62fd259b58753e6045b302146cc9","signing_date":"1935-12-10","text_path":"jobs/mabillon-held-printings/output/texts/EO_7245.txt","text_sha256":"7082d4e14051d8644e983e6c269675a81243c518aedba6bb0800b65e45d7a7d3","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Executive_Orders_7082-7261.djvu"},"verb":"amend"},{"actor_id":"EO:7274","char_end":783,"char_start":63,"confidence":"medium","how_named":"parent_as_amended","id":"CHAIN:EO:7373#4","notes":"Change wording lead; chronology does not decide legal effect.","provision_text":"Executive Order\n\nAMENDMENT OF EXECUTIVE ORDER No. 6910, or NOVEMBER 26, 1934, As\nAMENDED, WITHDRAWING PuBLic LAND IN CERTAIN STATES\n\nBy virtue of and pursuant to the authority vested in me by the act of June 25,\n1910, ch. 421, 36 Stat. 847, as amended by the act of August 24, 1912, ch. 369, 37\nStat. 497, Executive Order No. 6910, of November 26, 1934, as amended, withdrawing\npublic land in certain States, is hereby further amended by excluding from the opera-\ntion thereof all lands which are now, or may hereafter be, included within grazing\ndistricts duly established pursuant to the provisions of the act of June 28, 1934,\n\nch. 865, 48 Stat. 1269, so long as such lands remain a part of any such grazing district.","sections_touched":["partial"],"signing_date":"1936-01-14","source":{"acceptable_as_original":false,"filing_date":null,"grade":"machine_read_government_printed_copy","instrument_id":"EO:7274","location_confidence":"high","location_verified":false,"page_or_item":"Executive_Orders_7262-8027.djvu; scanned pages 32-33; closing number tag 7274","requires_page_check":false,"sha256":"93e5cb0ed596f00e69d7b555ccf563e775625e7682188ee5cf6670ad0127d0e1","signing_date":"1936-01-14","text_path":"jobs/mabillon-held-printings/output/texts/EO_7274.txt","text_sha256":"b427a75c5ac3b6083ceac0a3304f65e5001c23014e221a373e83d69e1b76496a","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Executive_Orders_7262-8027.djvu"},"verb":"amend"},{"actor_id":"EO:7331","char_end":1859,"char_start":741,"confidence":"medium","how_named":"parent_as_amended","id":"CHAIN:EO:7373#5","notes":"Change wording lead; chronology does not decide legal effect.","provision_text":"By virtue of and pursuant to the authority vested in me \nby the act of June 25, 1910, ch. 421, 36 Stat. 847, as amended \nby the act of August 24, 1912, ch. 369, 37 Stat. 497, and \nsubject to the conditions therein expressed and to valid ex­\nisting rights, it is ordered that the following-described lands \nbe, and they are hereby, temporarily withdrawn from set­\ntlement, location, sale, entry, and all forms of appropriation, \nfor use by the War Department in connection with the Fort \nPeck Dam and Reservoir, Federal Project No. 30, Federal \nEmergency Administration of Public Works:\nM ontana  P rincipal  M eridian\nT. 26 N„ R. 42 E.,  \nsec. 2, lot 7;\nsec. 3, lot 4, sw%Nwvi, w y4swy4 l sy2s&; \nsec. 4, lots 2, 5, S W & N W & , S ^ .\nT. 27 N„ R. 42 E.,\nsec. 33, lots 3, 4, 6, 7, NVfcSW1 /^, approximately 914.87 acres.\nExecutive Order No. 6910 of November 26,1934, as amended \nby Executive Order No. 7274 of January 14, 1936, is hereby \nmodified to the extent necessary to make this order effective.\nThis order shall continue in full force and effect unless and \nuntil revoked by the President or by act of Congress.","sections_touched":["partial"],"signing_date":"1936-04-03","source":{"acceptable_as_original":false,"filing_date":null,"grade":"machine_read_government_printed_copy","instrument_id":"EO:7331","location_confidence":"high","location_verified":false,"page_or_item":"Federal Register 1936-04-08; PDF pages 1-3","requires_page_check":false,"sha256":"8e298a6ea071bc34fa4e749a333462ad13ab257454e257dc91929ced8409eac4","signing_date":"1936-04-03","text_path":"jobs/tischendorf-originals/output/texts/EO_7331.txt","text_sha256":"2c3a3cae7694dc18d187a850a3fd59157d7e74742d5478a328580d4b50161631","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1936-04-08/pdf/FR-1936-04-08.pdf"},"verb":"revoke"},{"actor_id":"EO:7364","char_end":2720,"char_start":2507,"confidence":"medium","how_named":"parent_as_amended","id":"CHAIN:EO:7373#6","notes":"Change wording lead; chronology does not decide legal effect.","provision_text":"The reservation made by this order supersedes as to the  \nabove-described lands the temporary withdrawal for classi­\nfication and other purposes made by Executive Order No.  \n6910 of November 26, 1934, as amended.","sections_touched":["whole_via_parent"],"signing_date":"1936-05-06","source":{"acceptable_as_original":false,"filing_date":null,"gr