:7373#15","notes":"Change wording lead; chronology does not decide legal effect.","provision_text":"By virtue of and pursuant to the authority vested in me \nby the act o f June 25, 1910, ch. 421, 36 Stat. 847, as amended \nby the act o f August 24, 1912, ch. 369, 37 Stat. 497, it is \nordered that the following-described land in the State of \nArizona be, and it is hereby, tem porarily withdrawn from  set­\ntlement, location, sale, or entry and reserved for use o f the \nW ar Departm ent as an enlargem ent o f a target range used \nby the Arizona National Guard:\nT. 1 N., R. 3 W., G. & S. R. M.,  \nsec. 6, All\nsec. 7, Wi/2NEV4, NWy4  \nT. 2 N., R. 3 W., G. & S. R. M.,  \nsec. 30, All  \nsec. 31, All.\nExecutive Order No. 6910 dated Novem ber 26, 1934, as \namended, is hereby m odified to the extent necessary to make \nthis order effective.\nThis order shall continue in fu ll force and effect unless \nand until revoked by the President or by act o f Congress.","sections_touched":["partial"],"signing_date":"1936-12-16","source":{"acceptable_as_original":false,"filing_date":null,"grade":"machine_read_government_printed_copy","instrument_id":"EO:7515","location_confidence":"high","location_verified":false,"page_or_item":"Federal Register 1936-12-18; PDF pages 3-3","requires_page_check":false,"sha256":"09d81a5b58f9f4009ad64c817c2f868ab3983cf1001c24a3d904848c21f5e6b3","signing_date":"1936-12-16","text_path":"jobs/tischendorf-originals/output/texts/EO_7515.txt","text_sha256":"9093fdff41bf94eb88597b26b970c35d04538b0ec810fac320fa4160871f52bf","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1936-12-18/pdf/FR-1936-12-18.pdf"},"verb":"revoke"},{"actor_id":"EO:7599","char_end":1542,"char_start":599,"confidence":"medium","how_named":"parent_as_amended","id":"CHAIN:EO:7373#16","notes":"Change wording lead; chronology does not decide legal effect.","provision_text":"=== PDF page 1 ===\nExecutive Order\nAMENDMENT OF EXECUTIVE ORDERS NO. 6910 OF NOVEMBER 26,\n1934* AS AMENDED, AND NO. 6964 OF FEBRUARY 3, 1935, AS\nAMENDED, WITHDRAWING PUBLIC LANDS IN CERTAIN STATES\nBy virtue of and pursuant to the authority vested in me\nby the act of June 25, 1910, ch. 421, 36 Stat. 847, as\namended by the act of August 24, 1912, ch. 369, 37 Stat. 497,\nit is ordered that Executive Orders No. 6910 of November\n26, 1934, as amended, and No. 6964 of February 5, 1935, as\namended, withdrawing public lands in certain States, be,\nand they are hereby, further amended by excluding from\ntheir operation all lands which are identified by survey\nmade after the respective dates of the orders, and which\nupon the date of the acceptance of the survey thereof by\nthe Commissioner of the General Land Office would other­\nwise become a part of the school-land grant of designated\nsections to any of the States mentioned in the said orders.","sections_touched":["partial"],"signing_date":"1937-04-01","source":{"filing_date":null,"location_confidence":"high","location_verified":false,"page_or_item":"2 FR 747, PDF pages 1-1","requires_page_check":false,"sha256":"9f70bb8fbf77d6c23d99d27c11e94da77ae857f196e254f283e6258bff7824ac","signing_date":"1937-04-01","text_path":"jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_7599.recheck.txt","text_sha256":"224c0f70c5b02995542abca80d26f631b8d9a2aec8cb5093b296b27bb1c690bc","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1937-04-03/pdf/FR-1937-04-03.pdf"},"verb":"amend"},{"actor_id":"EO:7713","char_end":2951,"char_start":1360,"confidence":"medium","how_named":"parent_as_amended","id":"CHAIN:EO:7373#17","notes":"Change wording lead; chronology does not decide legal effect.","provision_text":"E x ec u tive O rder\nESTABLISHING LAKE THIBADEAU MIGRATORY WATERFOWL REFUGE\nMontana\nBy virtue of and pursuant to the authority vested in me \nby the act of June 25, 1910, ch. 421, 36 Stat. 847, as amended \nby the act of August 24, 1912, ch. 369, 37 Stat. 497, and as \nPresident of the United States, and in order to effectuate \nfurther the purposes of the Migratory Bird Conservation \nAct (45 Stat. 1222), it is ordered that all the lands now or \nhereafter owned or controlled by the United States within \nthe following-described area, comprising 3,668.48 acres, more \nor less, in Hill County, Montana, be, and they are hereby, \nwithdrawn from settlement, location, sale, or entry, and re­\nserved and set apart, subject to valid existing rights, for the \nuse of the Department of Agriculture as a refuge and breed­\ning ground for migratory birds and other wildlife: Provided,  \nthat any private lands within the area described shall be­\ncome a part of the refuge hereby established upon the ac­\nquisition of title thereto or control thereof by the United \nStates:\nPrincipal  M eridian\nT. 34 N., R. 16 E.,\nsec. 1, lots 1  to 4, inclusive, and S % N ‘ A ; \nsec. 2, lots 1  to 4, inclusive, and sy2N ^ ;  \nsec. 3, lots 1 and 2, and S^4NE%;\nT. 35 N., R. 16 E„  \nsec. 22, E%;  \nsec. 23, and SWV4!  \nsec. 26; -  \nsec. 27, E%;  \nsec. 34, E  \nsec. 35; \nsec. 36, WVi-\nThe reservation made by this order supersedes as to any \nof the above-described lands affected thereby the temporary\nwithdrawal for classification and other purposes made by \nExecutive Order No. 6910 of November 26, 1934, as amended.","sections_touched":["whole_via_parent"],"signing_date":"1937-09-23","source":{"filing_date":null,"location_confidence":"high","location_verified":false,"page_or_item":"2 FR 2281, PDF pages 1-1","requires_page_check":false,"sha256":"fe5b812242e907f12a8bdab7078e4c2c94036a259c1200a5444c7e4daa1cc531","signing_date":"1937-09-23","text_path":"jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_7713.txt","text_sha256":"3bbf2a4b9decd8fedfee38021e69eacdf4bfcc45ccbea4fa5136a71f8412a411","url":"https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1937-09-28/pdf/FR-1937-09-28.pdf"},"verb":"supersede"},{"actor_id":"EO:8113","char_end":6058,"char_start":5841,"confidence":"medium","how_named":"parent_as_amended","id":"CHAIN:EO:7373#18","notes":"Change wording lead; 